1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,280
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:12,480
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,320
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:19,200
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,800
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:26,360
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,080
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,720
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,200
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,200
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,880
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,640
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,000
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:42,480
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,480
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:51,560
Lady Feng, I came to see you.

17
00:00:56,759 --> 00:00:57,920
You shameless wretch.

18
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:58,759
You worthless maid!

19
00:00:59,799 --> 00:01:01,280
Lady Feng.

20
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,640
Don't blame me.

21
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:05,400
Blame yourself for overreaching.

22
00:01:05,599 --> 00:01:07,879
You knew Ms. Lu liked Commander He too,

23
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:09,519
yet you still competed with her.

24
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:13,519
Even if I hadn't done what I did,

25
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:15,280
if you went against Ms. Lu,

26
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:18,079
you'd have ended up just as badly.

27
00:01:18,239 --> 00:01:19,879
Why put yourself through all that?

28
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,319
You don't know a darn thing.

29
00:01:21,439 --> 00:01:22,640
Jingchen doesn't even like her.

30
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,719
He doesn't like her!

31
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,519
Lady Feng.

32
00:01:26,519 --> 00:01:28,000
You still don't get it.

33
00:01:28,159 --> 00:01:31,079
You're the one
Commander He doesn't like.

34
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:33,959
Oh, right.

35
00:01:34,359 --> 00:01:35,359
I forgot to tell you.

36
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:39,040
I'm the Fourteenth Concubine now.

37
00:01:40,159 --> 00:01:41,959
I'll take your fate as a warning.

38
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:45,799
I won't make the same mistakes you did.

39
00:01:47,079 --> 00:01:48,560
You shameless wretch!

40
00:01:48,599 --> 00:01:50,840
You'll come to a bad end!

41
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:53,680
=Episode 13=

42
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:10,520
Your role now, Commander He,

43
00:02:10,879 --> 00:02:13,800
is to be troubled because Ms. Lu

44
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,400
is after you for your looks.

45
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:18,560
We shouldn't be getting this close.

46
00:02:18,599 --> 00:02:20,960
Save that sharp tongue for Iron Leopard.

47
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,520
I need you to do something.

48
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:26,759
Go ahead.

49
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:29,240
Talk Iron Leopard out of killing her.

50
00:02:30,319 --> 00:02:31,639
Keep Feng Yanyan alive.

51
00:02:33,879 --> 00:02:34,680
He Jingchen.

52
00:02:36,479 --> 00:02:38,319
He was the one who killed them.

53
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,400
Why didn't you explain

54
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:41,439
when I blamed you before?

55
00:02:42,719 --> 00:02:44,199
I don't care if you misunderstand me.

56
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:46,719
As for what I asked you to do,

57
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:48,120
you'd better do your best.

58
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:50,319
Don't think having leverage over me

59
00:02:50,319 --> 00:02:51,520
means you can lord it over me.

60
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:54,080
I'm not that stupid.

61
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,960
You need proof of an affair.

62
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,680
If I accuse you and Feng Yanyan now,

63
00:02:58,719 --> 00:03:00,319
who'd believe me without proof?

64
00:03:02,159 --> 00:03:05,000
It's nice working with someone smart.

65
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:11,360
(If Lu Zhentian really wants her dead,)

66
00:03:11,599 --> 00:03:14,240
(and He Jingchen truly cares about her,)

67
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,319
(maybe...)

68
00:03:15,319 --> 00:03:17,919
(This is my chance
to gain the upper hand.)

69
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,919
(I need to kill two birds
with one stone.)

70
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,000
(Win Lu Zhentian's complete trust)

71
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,800
(and gain leverage over He Jingchen.)

72
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,719
Ms. Lu.

73
00:03:29,759 --> 00:03:30,919
Lady Que.

74
00:03:32,039 --> 00:03:34,159
Earlier today, with the governor there,

75
00:03:34,479 --> 00:03:35,680
there were things I couldn't say.

76
00:03:36,039 --> 00:03:37,159
Ms. Lu.

77
00:03:37,159 --> 00:03:39,560
Even as the Fourteenth Concubine,

78
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:41,240
I still feel the same way.

79
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:43,360
I'm willing to live peacefully with you.

80
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:46,000
I absolutely won't
follow Lady Feng's example

81
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,400
and oppose you at every turn.

82
00:03:47,719 --> 00:03:50,080
If there's ever anything I can do,

83
00:03:50,439 --> 00:03:51,520
just ask.

84
00:03:54,599 --> 00:03:57,919
Lady Que,
you seem sure I'm planning something.

85
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:01,319
What do you think I'm planning?

86
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:06,039
Your feelings for Commander He
are sincere.

87
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:07,960
Your sincerity will move him someday.

88
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:10,800
Given Commander He's position now,

89
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,800
once the two of you are together,

90
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:16,079
you'll both be calling the shots here.

91
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:21,639
(Talk Iron Leopard out of killing her.)

92
00:04:22,879 --> 00:04:24,160
(Keep Feng Yanyan alive.)

93
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,920
So that's what you think.

94
00:04:30,519 --> 00:04:32,560
Since you're so eager to know,

95
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,600
I'll tell you.

96
00:04:34,959 --> 00:04:36,720
The woman
locked up in the back courtyard...

97
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:39,279
Please don't finish her off, Lady Que.

98
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:42,079
I don't want her to become
the twelfth memorial tablet.

99
00:04:50,399 --> 00:04:51,399
Look at you.

100
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,240
Such a young face.

101
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:55,519
And such a young belly.

102
00:04:56,319 --> 00:04:57,879
Young is good.

103
00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:59,319
Do me proud.

104
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,360
How about giving me a healthy baby boy?

105
00:05:01,399 --> 00:05:02,279
No.

106
00:05:25,839 --> 00:05:26,920
He Jingchen.

107
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:29,879
There's something I still don't get.

108
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:33,000
Maybe you can explain it to me.

109
00:05:36,639 --> 00:05:38,879
Why exactly
are you so good to Feng Yanyan?

110
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,399
If you care about her that much,

111
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,959
why won't you give her a child?

112
00:05:46,839 --> 00:05:49,160
If Feng Yanyan really had a son,

113
00:05:50,279 --> 00:05:53,160
he'd inherit the treasure map someday.

114
00:05:53,439 --> 00:05:55,839
Her son would be yours too.

115
00:05:56,279 --> 00:05:58,079
You'd still stand to gain the most.

116
00:05:58,839 --> 00:06:00,959
Why pass up the easy way

117
00:06:01,079 --> 00:06:03,199
and choose an unruly impostor like me?

118
00:06:03,439 --> 00:06:05,519
Just to have a son inherit the map?

119
00:06:09,079 --> 00:06:11,439
(The people of Fancheng
can't wait that long.)

120
00:06:12,519 --> 00:06:14,079
I can't wait that long.

121
00:06:16,319 --> 00:06:17,399
Liar.

122
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,160
You don't mean that.

123
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,879
Think whatever you want.

124
00:06:24,959 --> 00:06:26,240
I figured it out long ago.

125
00:06:26,839 --> 00:06:29,040
You have no feelings for Feng Yanyan.

126
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:31,279
That's why you won't give her a child.

127
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,839
You're a man

128
00:06:36,839 --> 00:06:38,360
with such lofty ambitions,

129
00:06:38,839 --> 00:06:41,279
yet you make such a big deal of it.

130
00:06:41,439 --> 00:06:42,920
You won't even make that sacrifice?

131
00:06:52,279 --> 00:06:53,560
So you're saying

132
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,319
if it were you,

133
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,199
you would?

134
00:06:58,759 --> 00:07:00,240
Why are you changing the subject?

135
00:07:00,839 --> 00:07:02,439
I don't have ambitions that grand.

136
00:07:07,399 --> 00:07:08,199
Oh, right.

137
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,279
I looked into it.

138
00:07:10,879 --> 00:07:13,680
That drug is a staple
at Yingchun Brothel.

139
00:07:14,439 --> 00:07:16,480
They say after taking it,

140
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:19,600
you see whoever you're thinking about.

141
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,079
Commander He.

142
00:07:23,519 --> 00:07:24,959
Is there someone you like?

143
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,759
Who did you see when you looked at
Feng Yanyan?

144
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:43,240
(Can I stay tonight?)

145
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:46,440
♪I secretly take your♪

146
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:49,000
♪Old hairpin and repaint it♪

147
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,440
♪Imagining your smile♪

148
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:51,920
♪Ripples stir within my heart♪

149
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:54,480
Who was it the other day who said

150
00:07:55,439 --> 00:07:57,759
we shouldn't be getting this close?

151
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:01,160
♪I long to take you to see♪

152
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:03,680
♪The Qixi shadow-puppet show♪

153
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:04,760
♪Your favorite...♪

154
00:08:04,839 --> 00:08:06,319
You're getting bolder and bolder.

155
00:08:08,519 --> 00:08:11,319
What I said then was about your role,

156
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,360
not mine.

157
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:14,160
♪The chill as rain begins to fall♪

158
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:18,240
♪You slip beneath my paper umbrella♪

159
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:21,160
♪And lean close by my side♪

160
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:27,800
My role is to be obsessed with
Commander He's good looks

161
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:30,120
and never give up on him.

162
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,559
So I'm doing nothing wrong, right?

163
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:37,159
Looks like Ms. Lu still enjoys
teasing Commander He.

164
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:38,879
Commander He has all these skills

165
00:08:39,399 --> 00:08:40,559
but can't use any of them.

166
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,159
That must be frustrating.

167
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:43,919
In that case,

168
00:08:45,799 --> 00:08:47,320
I'll play

169
00:08:47,639 --> 00:08:50,440
Commander He, under Ms. Lu's thumb.

170
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:53,400
♪Hearing night rain on a painted boat♪

171
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:56,120
♪Where you and I first met♪

172
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:59,840
When a woman pursues a man,
there's little standing in her way.

173
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,680
♪Music from the black-canopied boat♪

174
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:05,320
♪Deepening the sorrow of parting♪

175
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:08,279
Everyone likes a pretty face.

176
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,639
Just like I do.

177
00:09:09,639 --> 00:09:13,000
♪The rain falls as the wind goes still♪

178
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,240
♪If I bring up the past again♪

179
00:09:14,640 --> 00:09:16,760
♪Our carefree childhood days together♪

180
00:09:17,160 --> 00:09:19,880
♪Would you mind if I called it love?♪

181
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:22,520
♪I couldn't help but fall for you♪

182
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:23,840
Don't you love putting on an act?

183
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:24,919
Tell me.

184
00:09:26,559 --> 00:09:29,120
Should I tell Iron Leopard tomorrow

185
00:09:29,399 --> 00:09:30,720
that I've fallen for you?

186
00:09:31,039 --> 00:09:33,799
Think he'd make me
the Lu family's son-in-law?

187
00:09:35,039 --> 00:09:36,480
I think he would.

188
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,519
I'm kidding.

189
00:09:44,279 --> 00:09:45,440
Look how scared you are.

190
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,320
Creep.

191
00:10:05,399 --> 00:10:06,399
Where are you?

192
00:10:06,399 --> 00:10:07,320
Don't be afraid.

193
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,400
(Young He Jingchen)

194
00:10:16,679 --> 00:10:17,679
Here. Eat.

195
00:10:22,559 --> 00:10:23,519
Thank you.

196
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:25,440
When no one's around tonight,

197
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,720
sneak out.

198
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,840
If you can't get away, it's okay.

199
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:30,440
I'll come back with more buns.

200
00:10:30,639 --> 00:10:31,759
You're so kind.

201
00:10:34,559 --> 00:10:35,480
You can have this too.

202
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:36,320
It's sweet.

203
00:10:41,759 --> 00:10:42,960
(Why?)

204
00:10:43,399 --> 00:10:45,399
(Why does she always remind me
of that day?)

205
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:48,440
(Governor's Residence)

206
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,320
Lady Que.

207
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:55,080
The barbecue pork buns are good today.

208
00:10:56,799 --> 00:10:57,879
Thank you, Ms. Lu.

209
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,200
Have you eaten?

210
00:10:59,200 --> 00:10:59,420
Mm-hmm.

211
00:10:59,759 --> 00:11:00,559
I have.

212
00:11:04,519 --> 00:11:05,159
By the way,

213
00:11:05,759 --> 00:11:07,759
I didn't finish
what I was saying that day.

214
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:11,120
I said I didn't want more bloodshed at
the Governor's Residence,

215
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:16,279
but I don't want that woman in the
back courtyard to have it easy either.

216
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:17,960
Understood.

217
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:19,039
Don't worry, Ms. Lu.

218
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:22,600
Enjoy your meal, Lady Que.

219
00:11:26,759 --> 00:11:27,559
(Feng Yanyan.)

220
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:30,360
(When you made my life miserable,)

221
00:11:30,759 --> 00:11:32,559
(did you think this day would come?)

222
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:58,280
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

223
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:02,920
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

224
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:06,080
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

225
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,600
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

226
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:12,960
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

227
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:18,920
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

228
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:23,640
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

229
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:27,120
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

230
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:29,440
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

231
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:32,680
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

232
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:39,360
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

233
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:42,960
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

234
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:46,160
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

235
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:52,680
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

236
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:56,080
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

237
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:59,400
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

238
00:12:59,820 --> 00:13:02,240
♪Boundless♪
